-- ============================================================
-- HOW TO SAVE AS AN ALERT IN SPLUNK
-- ============================================================
-- Title     : Privilege Escalation / Group Change Detected
-- Schedule  : Run every 5 minutes
-- Time range: Last 5 minutes
-- Trigger   : Number of Results > 0
-- Severity  : Critical
-- ============================================================
